In `files/tests/qa/testcase.py`, `_drive` calls `build_instance_from_scenario(..., is_root=True, ...)`, so each top-level test starts with `is_root=True`. But in `src/cfnlint/context/conditions/_utils.py`, the function makes recursive calls from the list branch with `is_root=False`, and from the root-dict iteration branch with `is_root=False` as well. The suite includes lists, root dicts, and nested structures that exercise those branches, so not every observed call has `is_root == True`.

